      "outputs": [],
      "title": "How it works",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "1. Pick a GIF in Load GIF (upload one, or choose a file in the input folder).\n2. GIF Optimise re-encodes it. This uses mode smallest; try target_size and set target_size_mb for a size budget.\n3. Video Compare plays the two together with a wipe slider. A is the original, B is the optimised GIF.\n4. GIF Analyse measures both and reports sizes, frame counts, SSIM and PSNR, so you can see what the saving cost in quality."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "1. Pick a GIF in Load GIF (upload one, or choose a file in the input folder).\n2. GIF Optimise re-encodes it. This uses mode smallest; try target_size and set target_size_mb for a size budget.\n3. Video Compare plays the two together with a wipe slider. A is the original, B is the optimised GIF.\n4. GIF Analyse measures both and reports sizes, frame counts, SSIM and PSNR, so you can see what the saving cost in quality."
      },
